    "body": "\"nearest [ancestor](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-ancestor)\" does not permit crossing shadow boundaries. Crossing shadow boundaries would require using [shadow-including ancestor](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-including-ancestor).\r\n\r\nI think the spec here is probably correct, especially since it's consistent with other ownership relationships like the submit button/form ownership boundary. So IMO this should be filed as a Chromium bug. /cc @josepharhar.",
